  "author": "Imam Ahmad Raza Khan",
  "description": "A scholarly treatise by Imam Ahmad Raza Khan establishing the beliefs of Ahle Sunnat regarding the Prophet's knowledge of the unseen (ilm-e-ghaib) and other extraordinary virtues granted by Allah. It presents Quranic verses, hadiths, and rational arguments to refute objections and affirm the comprehensive knowledge bestowed upon the Prophet Muhammad صلى الله عليه وسلم صلى الله عليه وسلم .",
